{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51417","headline":"过九疑山有怀 · 李合","name":"过九疑山有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚度疑山道，依然想重华。\n云飘上苑叶，雪映御沟花。\n行叹戍麾远，坐令衣带赊。\n交何通绝徼，弱水浸流沙。\n旅思徒漂梗，归期未及瓜。\n两阶干羽绝，夜夜泣胡笳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}